+/* ── fe_extc: FMFP_EXTC (FPM External Requests Control, CCSR 0x074)
+ * SYNC probe -- F-167, Task #26 follow-up. See arch/fman-microcode-210-
+ * programming-reference.md §5.3.4. Standalone: does not touch any
